WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.425
Hi! I'm Momo. Let's practice One coffee, please..

2
00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:08.244
oat milk

3
00:00:08.644 --> 00:00:09.884
to go

4
00:00:10.284 --> 00:00:11.743
decaf

5
00:00:12.143 --> 00:00:15.208
Could I get an iced latte, please?

6
00:00:15.608 --> 00:00:17.792
Can I have it with oat milk?

7
00:00:18.192 --> 00:00:20.377
To go, please.

8
00:00:20.777 --> 00:00:22.851
Could you make it decaf?

9
00:00:23.251 --> 00:00:25.661
That's all, thank you.

10
00:00:26.061 --> 00:00:29.230
Hi! What can I get for you?

11
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.375
Could I get an iced latte with oat milk, please?

12
00:00:33.775 --> 00:00:37.124
Of course. For here or to go?

13
00:00:37.524 --> 00:00:42.119
To go, please. That's all, thank you.

14
00:00:42.519 --> 00:00:46.888
Remember this expression. To go, please.

15
00:00:47.288 --> 00:00:54.003
Great job! Pause, repeat, and make it your own. See you in the next lesson!
